title: news_crashesAtRationale
color: blue
position: 0,0
---
Kallistians' collision by The Rationale highlights need for restrictions on ship permits.
Until then remember to use POJ for maneuverability when dining out.
===
title: news_meteorWarning
color: blue
position: 0,0
---
Meteor warning from 17 to 20.
Remember to allocate POJ for durability to protect from the scatter.
===
title: news_insekczyk
color: blue
position: 0,0
---
The latest report from the unified studies have concluded that a single serving of Insekczyk can provide a significant increase to social interpretation and comportment for at least 12 hours post consumption.
===
title: news_gestionPrize
color: blue
position: 0,0
---
Zoe Eklekta from Ganymede to receive prize for excellent gestion. Your time is valuable so do like Zoe and make the most of it.
===
title: news_missingColour
color: blue
position: 0,0
---
Colouring supplies still missing.
In spite of the recent search, the rainbow building, as it is colloquially called, advises anyone visiting Kallisto to keep their eye out.
===
title: news_natureNurture
color: blue
position: 0,0
---
After extensive research, the unified studies have finally found a conclusive answer to the question of nature versus nuture.
It seems the actions of a parent shape the child significantly more than their genes, so be on your best behaviour if you want to raise them well.
===

